<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<WorkflowBuilder Version="2.9.0"
                 xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance"
                 xmlns:rx="clr-namespace:Bonsai.Reactive;assembly=Bonsai.Core"
                 xmlns:sys="clr-namespace:System;assembly=mscorlib"
                 xmlns:core="clr-namespace:OpenRigs.Core;assembly=OpenRigs.Core"
                 xmlns:dev="clr-namespace:OpenRigs.Devices;assembly=OpenRigs.Devices"
                 xmlns="https://bonsai-rx.org/2018/workflow">
  <Description>A Behavior board's pulsed output lines (Board), for a rig with reward valves on it: closes the lines rig.yml's pulseController.outputPulseEnable names, sets the ZapitTrigger line's width to its FixedPulse and pulse-enables the lines (PulseSetupWrites), 0.5 s after the board's first message, then announces PulsesEnabled into ReadyStages, so Ready (ReadyGate PieceStages) waits for it and no pulse can go to a line not yet in pulse mode. Declares the board's Board.TriggerCalibratedPulse (BoardTriggerCalibratedPulseSubjectName), a BehaviorSubject of (line, width in ms) such as (DO1, 38), and fires each on the board: the line's width, then the line set (CalibratedPulseWrites), on any line the board can pulse, DO0 to DO3 or DOPort0 to DOPort2. Stops the workflow at start if a line wiring gives a RewardValve is not pulse-enabled, as a reward would then open the valve and leave it open, or the ZapitTrigger's line is not pulse-enabled or has no FixedPulse width above 0 ms, as a workflow that died with it high would then leave it on.</Description>
  <Workflow>
    <Nodes>
      <Expression xsi:type="ExternalizedMapping">
        <Property Name="Board" Description="The Behavior board whose lines are pulsed, such as BehaviorBoard-Main." />
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
        <Name>RigConfigs</Name>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
        <Combinator xsi:type="dev:PulseSetupWrites">
          <dev:Board>UNMAPPED</dev:Board>
        </Combinator>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="ExternalizedMapping">
        <Property Name="Name" DisplayName="BoardDataSubjectName" Description="Board.Data: the board's message subject." Category="Subjects" />
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
        <Name>UNMAPPED</Name>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
        <Combinator xsi:type="rx:Take">
          <rx:Count>1</rx:Count>
        </Combinator>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
        <Combinator xsi:type="rx:Delay">
          <rx:DueTime>PT0.5S</rx:DueTime>
        </Combinator>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
        <Combinator xsi:type="rx:SubscribeWhen" />
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="ExternalizedMapping">
        <Property Name="Name" DisplayName="BoardCommandsSubjectName" Description="Board.Commands: the board's command subject." Category="Subjects" />
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="MulticastSubject">
        <Name>UNMAPPED</Name>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
        <Combinator xsi:type="core:AnnounceStage">
          <core:Stage>PulsesEnabled</core:Stage>
        </Combinator>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="MulticastSubject">
        <Name>ReadyStages</Name>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="ExternalizedMapping">
        <Property Name="Name" DisplayName="BoardTriggerCalibratedPulseSubjectName" Description="Board.TriggerCalibratedPulse: the subject each (line, width in ms) pulse for this board is sent into." Category="Subjects" />
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="rx:BehaviorSubject" TypeArguments="sys:Tuple(sys:String,sys:Int32)">
        <rx:Name>UNMAPPED</rx:Name>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
        <Name>UNMAPPED</Name>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
        <Combinator xsi:type="dev:CalibratedPulseWrites" />
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="MulticastSubject">
        <Name>UNMAPPED</Name>
      </Expression>
    </Nodes>
    <Edges>
      <Edge From="0" To="2" Label="Source2" />
      <Edge From="1" To="2" Label="Source1" />
      <Edge From="3" To="4" Label="Source1" />
      <Edge From="4" To="5" Label="Source1" />
      <Edge From="5" To="6" Label="Source1" />
      <Edge From="2" To="7" Label="Source1" />
      <Edge From="6" To="7" Label="Source2" />
      <Edge From="7" To="9" Label="Source1" />
      <Edge From="8" To="9" Label="Source2" />
      <Edge From="9" To="10" Label="Source1" />
      <Edge From="10" To="11" Label="Source1" />
      <Edge From="12" To="13" Label="Source1" />
      <Edge From="12" To="14" Label="Source1" />
      <Edge From="14" To="15" Label="Source1" />
      <Edge From="15" To="16" Label="Source1" />
      <Edge From="8" To="16" Label="Source2" />
    </Edges>
  </Workflow>
</WorkflowBuilder>
